{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56274","headline":"春（题拟） · 晓峦","name":"春（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滩潄金沙过枕前，雨丝斜织麯尘烟。\n绿杨红杏宜寒食，紫雁黄鹂聒昼眠。\n（见明刻本《锦绣万花谷前集》卷三。\n《古今合璧事类备要前集》卷二录第二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晓峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}